  "sourceTitle": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (104 GB MoE) on a Strix Halo + RTX 3090 Ti eGPU: 22 -> 84 tok/s, and within one HumanEval+ problem of a dual-3090 vLLM box at 0.4x the wall time",
  "sourceBodyHash": "3f817de5a901e04661e424af33d4abf6f0bc159b602e5dce4a81d16a3cd44cdd",
